156
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:03,570
Jawabannya B.

157
00:09:03,930 --> 00:09:08,410
Inilah alasan penangkapan gas sampah termasuk mitigasi yang sangat efektif.

158
00:09:08,830 --> 00:09:10,970
